          "comment": "# Assemble a UGC Product Video\n\nCombines a creator testimonial with a product demonstration placed on top as a silent picture-in-picture. The creator stays on camera for the whole vertical reel.\n\n**How it works:** \"1 Creator testimonial\" provides the main clip and \"2 Product proof\" provides the overlay. \"3 Add proof without leaving camera\" places the proof at x 720, y 1010, scaled to 0.28 with its audio muted. \"4 UGC Reel\" shows the finished video.\n\n**Try this:** Change x, y and scale on the Overlay node to move the proof clip, for example to the top-left corner."
